%% W2D1 — Type-Safe Schemas with Pydantic AI — Architecture Overview
graph LR
    subgraph "Application Layer"
        App[Application Code]
        Schema[Pydantic BaseModel\nOutput Schema]
    end

    subgraph "Pydantic AI Agent"
        SchemaSerializer[Schema Serialiser\nJSON Schema Builder]
        PromptBuilder[Prompt Builder\nInjects Schema into System Prompt]
        RetryOrchestrator[Retry Orchestrator\nManages Validation Loop]
        Validator[Pydantic Validator\nField-Level Type Checks]
    end

    subgraph "LLM Provider"
        LLM[LLM API\nOpenAI / Anthropic / Ollama]
        NativeStructured[Native Structured Output\nJSON Schema Mode]
    end

    subgraph "Output"
        ValidResult[Validated Result\nTyped BaseModel Instance]
        RetryLog[Retry Log\nValidation Error + Offending Response]
        ErrorQueue[Error Queue\nExhausted Retries]
    end

    App -->|defines| Schema
    App -->|invokes agent.run| RetryOrchestrator
    Schema -->|model_json_schema| SchemaSerializer
    SchemaSerializer -->|schema string| PromptBuilder
    PromptBuilder -->|messages list| RetryOrchestrator
    RetryOrchestrator -->|prompt + messages| LLM
    LLM -->|raw text response| Validator
    LLM -->|structured output| NativeStructured
    NativeStructured -->|pre-validated JSON| Validator
    Validator -->|passes| ValidResult
    Validator -->|fails| RetryLog
    RetryLog -->|correction hint appended| RetryOrchestrator
    RetryOrchestrator -->|retries exhausted| ErrorQueue
    ValidResult -->|returns result.data| App
